    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Velocity Rush, a racing game that will take you to a world of high speeds, bright colors and endless adrenaline! Choose from six unique cars, each with its own features and driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features incredible visual effects stylized as futuristic neon and a soundtrack that will make your heart beat faster. Each race is a test of your reactions and your ability to keep your cool at extreme speeds. Will you be able to become the champion by overtaking all your rivals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Six unique cars with different speed and control characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Artificial intelligence of opponents, adapting to your style of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylized visual style inspired by neon and futuristic design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Speed gameplay designed for adrenaline junkies.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Velocity Rush, a racing game that will take you to a world of high speeds, bright colors and endless adrenaline! Choose from six unique cars, each with its own features and driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features incredible visual effects stylized as futuristic neon and a soundtrack that will make your heart beat faster. Each race is a test of your reactions and your ability to keep your cool at extreme speeds. Will you be able to become the champion by overtaking all your rivals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Six unique cars with different speed and control characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Artificial intelligence of opponents, adapting to your style of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylized visual style inspired by neon and futuristic design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Speed gameplay designed for adrenaline junkies.</p>",
